      "content_text": "Process Approach",
      "children": [
        {
          "block_id": "blk-process-overview",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "content_text": "The process approach links inputs, activities, outputs, and interactions so the quality system can be managed as connected processes."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "blk-pdca",
          "block_type": "toggle",
          "content_text": "PDCA",
          "children": [
            {
              "block_id": "blk-pdca-detail",
              "block_type": "paragraph",
              "content_text": "Plan defines objectives and resources, Do runs the work, Check reviews evidence, and Act improves the process based on results."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "blk-risk-thinking",
      "block_type": "heading_2",
      "content_text": "Risk-Based Thinking",
      "children": [
        {
          "block_id": "blk-risk-detail",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "content_text": "Risk-based thinking asks teams to prevent nonconformity early instead of reacting only after a defect appears."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
